exp 2.1 
AIM:- There is an integer array nums sorted in ascending order (with distinct values).
Algorithm: 
1.Set left = 0, right = n-1.
2.Find mid.
3.If nums[mid] == target, return mid.
4.Check which half is sorted:
If left half sorted:
Target in left range → right = mid-1
Else → left = mid+1
Else right half sorted:
Target in right range → left = mid+1
Else → right = mid-1
5.If not found, return -1.
CODE:-class Solution {
public:
    int search(vector<int>& nums, int target) {
        int left = 0;
        int right = nums.size() - 1;
        while (left <= right) {
            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;
            if (nums[mid] == target)
                return mid;
            // Left half is sorted
            if (nums[left] <= nums[mid]) {
                if (nums[left] <= target && target < nums[mid])
                    right = mid - 1;
                else
                    left = mid + 1;
            }
            // Right half is sorted
            else {
                if (nums[mid] < target && target <= nums[right])
                    left = mid + 1;
                else
                    right = mid - 1;
            }
        }
        return -1;
    }
};
exp 2.2 
AIM:- Given a sorted array of distinct integers and a target value, return the index if the target is found. If not, return the index where it would be if it were inserted in order.
You must write an algorithm with O(log n) runtime complexity.
Algorithm:-
1.Set left = 0, right = n-1.
2.Find mid.
3.If nums[mid] == target, return mid.
4.If nums[mid] < target, move left = mid+1; otherwise right = mid-1.
5.When loop ends, return left as the insertion index.
CODE:-class Solution {
public:
    int searchInsert(vector<int>& nums, int target) {
        int left = 0, right = nums.size() - 1;
        while (left <= right) {
            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;
            if (nums[mid] == target) return mid;
            else if (nums[mid] < target) left = mid + 1;
            else right = mid - 1;
        }
        return left;
    }
};

 
